&lt;p&gt;Rocket Money’s mission is to empower people to live their best financial lives. Rocket Money offers members a unique understanding of their finances and a suite of valuable services that save them time and money – ultimately giving them a leg up on their financial journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE 🤹‍♀️&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rocket Money is looking for a Senior Producer to join our Video Creative team. This isn&#39;t a traditional production role — we&#39;re looking for someone who understands direct response advertising inside and out, brings a strong creative voice, and knows how to turn raw concepts into high-performing content that entertains, educates, and converts. You&#39;ll work across digital and broadcast platforms, leading production from concept through delivery while helping us stand out in a competitive fintech space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work will be part of a weekly cadence driven by data — iterating on what&#39;s working, testing what&#39;s new, and constantly pushing the limits of what drives performance and acquires users&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own integrated production end-to-end — from concept through delivery, building effective direct-response ads for social media channels, digital platforms, and broadcast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shoot, direct, and produce original footage — you&#39;re comfortable on set and across all stages of production from pre to post&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compose motion graphic explainers and source new content to scale creative output — this goes well beyond cutting and arranging pre-existing clips&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase weekly output by releasing multiple variations of concepts across a wide range of sizes and formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the creative team on ideation, storyboarding, and concept development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iterate fast based on performance data — you believe data informs creativity, not limits it, and you&#39;re always optimizing for specific channels and platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with internal teams, production teams, external vendors, actors, and talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain budgets and timelines, identify and hire third-party vendors, and manage production costs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continue to improve workflows for production and delivery while maintaining and contributing to asset library structure and organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Format new and existing assets to properly fit all media platforms’ best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple projects simultaneously with swift turnaround times and a sharp eye for detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT YOU 🦄&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love producing for direct response and have a genuine instinct for how editing decisions impact the way users comprehend and respond to an ad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You believe data can inform creativity, not limit it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to envision and edit many different visual scenarios from a single set of raw video assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level proficiency in Premiere Pro and After Effects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong design sensibilities; experience with Figma and Adobe Photoshop is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable on a production set and across all stages of production from pre to post&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at presenting complex technical information in a clear and engaging format&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced with budgets, timelines, vendor management, and cost oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent time management skills with the ability to accurately assess scope and availability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative communicator who gives and receives feedback well and brings a fresh perspective to the table&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
